<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[Checkbox] 모든 항목을 선택하거나 선택 해제하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_8f59b338035aaddd" class="chapter_title">[Checkbox] 모든 항목을 선택하거나 선택 해제하기</h1><h1 id="r_f12afc40e7f5b355" class="element heading1" data-element-id="f12afc40e7f5b355"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_86fad3e880c7467d" class="element pre" data-element-id="86fad3e880c7467d">Checkbox의 'checkAll' 메소드를 사용하여 모든 항목을 선택하거나 선택을 해제하는 예제입니다. 메소드의 첫 번째 인자를 true로 설정하면 모든 항목이 선택되고, false로 설정하면 모든 항목의 선택이 해제됩니다.</pre><p id="r_95551d2a16b27343" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="95551d2a16b27343"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00365">P00365</a></p><h1 id="r_5151a3f1b66a755e" class="element heading1" data-element-id="5151a3f1b66a755e"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_0e9ac38ec2d5b037" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="0e9ac38ec2d5b037"><li><p>모든 항목을 선택하거나 선택 해제하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_43afd5aa097c1c10" class="element heading1" data-element-id="43afd5aa097c1c10"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_1543d6c21268e9f2" class="element heading2" data-element-id="1543d6c21268e9f2"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>모든 항목을 선택하거나 선택 해제하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_a4399a253f8054eb" class="element step1" data-element-id="a4399a253f8054eb"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">모든 항목 선택하기</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_0e63cde182a8be62" class="element step1" data-element-id="0e63cde182a8be62"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행된 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_60d0e429bf1d5eb0" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="60d0e429bf1d5eb0">모든 항목이 선택됩니다.</p><div id="r_f32c4eadc05fea16" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="f32c4eadc05fea16"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image316.png" width="214" height="84" /></p></div><div id="r_9335b90e3178b5df" class="element step1" data-element-id="9335b90e3178b5df"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>STEP 3: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">모든 항목 선택 해제하기</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_c39634549e90ab25" class="element step1" data-element-id="c39634549e90ab25"><p class="step1_n">4</p><p>STEP 4: 실행된 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_b36be14448cf2bff" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="b36be14448cf2bff">모든 항목의 선택이 해제됩니다.</p><div id="r_06e55d61cb06cd70" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="06e55d61cb06cd70"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image317.png" width="211" height="82" /></p></div><h1 id="r_b6f80c416e4c4b6c" class="element heading1" data-element-id="b6f80c416e4c4b6c"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_bbc6c891cbfacdb1" class="element heading2" data-element-id="bbc6c891cbfacdb1"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>모든 항목을 선택하거나 선택 해제하기</span></div></h2><p id="r_c433ca3714fe9764" class="element normal" data-element-id="c433ca3714fe9764">Checkbox의 'checkAll' 메소드를 사용하여 스크립트를 작성합니다.</p><div id="r_85060ec607c7681b" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="85060ec607c7681b"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Checkbox 'cbx_main'의 모든 항목을 선택하기</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>cbx_main.checkAll(<span class="r_h_keyword_span">true</span>);
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Checkbox 'cbx_main'의 모든 항목의 선택을 해제하기</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>cbx_main.checkAll(<span class="r_h_keyword_span">false</span>);</pre></div><h1 id="r_0f815795831d661b" class="element heading1" data-element-id="0f815795831d661b"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_33f96937851a3bb4" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="33f96937851a3bb4"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">checkAll( checkFlag )</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>